  "title": "Scheduled Ducklake maintenance",
  "summary": "Ducklakes can now run scheduled maintenance to keep growth in check - snapshot expiry with a configurable retention window (default 7 days), compaction of adjacent small parquet files, and orphaned file cleanup. Configured per lake in the workspace Ducklake settings with a cron cadence (default daily at 03h UTC) and executed as observable jobs whose run history is the audit trail. Enterprise feature.",
